p.hi:
Political Unrest in Nicaragua;
                        Policy of the United States Not To Interfere in Nicaraguan Internal
                        Affairs

row.cell:
To the Minister in Nicaragua (tel.)
Denial that interview took place;
                            explanation, however, of reasons why a public denial should be avoided;
                            willingness to consider authorizing a reiteration of U. S.
                            nonintervention policy.
